        "code": "import time\n\nn = 500_000\ndata = list(range(n))\n\nt0 = time.time()\ntotal_loop = 0\nfor x in data:\n    total_loop += x\nt_loop = time.time() - t0\n\nt0 = time.time()\ntotal_sum = sum(data)\nt_builtin = time.time() - t0\n\nprint(f\"Loop vaqti: {t_loop:.4f}s, Built-in vaqti: {t_builtin:.4f}s\")\nprint(\"Natijalar tengmi?\", total_loop == total_sum)",
