        "titleUz": "2-misol: Eigenvalue nima? — SVD (Singular Value Decomposition) Bilan Matritsani Qayta Tiklash",
        "explanationUz": "Har qanday $M$ matritsani $U \\Sigma V^T$ qismlariga ajratib, past o'lchamli siqish imkoniyati.",
