    "id": "mlds-15-11",
    "phaseId": "mlds-15",
    "order": 15,
    "title": "Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi",
    "status": "planned",
    "learningObjectiveUz": "«Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.",
    "theoryUz": "### Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi” — Kengaytirilgan A/B Testlash va CUPED yo'nalishining asosiy qismlaridan biridir.\nUshbu mavzuda o'rganiladigan asosiy terminlar: CUPED (Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data), Covariate, Variance Reduction, Stratification.\n«Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Matematik Mantiq (Under the Hood):**\nA/B Advanced vositalari yordamida parametrlar va matritsalar qat'iy mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda transformatsiya qilinadi. Kiruvchi ma'lumotlar o'lchami tekshiriladi, xatoliklar (chegaraviy shartlar) filtrlangan holda optimal natija hosil qilinadi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction quvurlarida ushbu usul ma'lumotlar oqimining barqarorligi, xotira tejamkorligi va modelning barqaror bashorat berishini kafolatlaydi.",
    "visualFlow": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "label": "Oldingi Ma'lumot (X)",
        "detail": "Foydalanuvchilarning testdan oldingi faollik ko'rsatkichi"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "label": "Eksperiment Natijasi (Y)",
        "detail": "Test davridagi xatti-harakatlar o'lchovi"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "label": "Kovariatsiya Koeffitsienti",
        "detail": "Theta = Cov(Y, X) / Var(X) ni hisoblash"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "label": "CUPED Metrikasi",
        "detail": "Dispersiyani 30-50% ga qisqartirib, test vaqtini tejash"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-15-11-1",
        "titleUz": "1-misol: Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi — CUPED Metrikasi va Dispersiyani Qisqartirish",
        "explanationUz": "Formula: $Y_{\\text{cuped}} = Y - \\theta (X - \\bar{X})$ bu yerda $\\theta = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(Y, X)}{\\text{Var}(X)}$.",
        "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndef apply_cuped(y_experiment: np.ndarray, x_pre_experiment: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    cov = np.cov(y_experiment, x_pre_experiment)[0, 1]\n    var_x = np.var(x_pre_experiment, ddof=1)\n    theta = cov / var_x if var_x > 0 else 0.0\n    return y_experiment - theta * (x_pre_experiment - np.mean(x_pre_experiment))\n\ny = np.array([12.0, 15.0, 20.0, 14.0, 18.0])\nx = np.array([10.0, 13.0, 19.0, 12.0, 17.0])\ny_cuped = apply_cuped(y, x)\nprint(\"Boshlang'ich dispersiya:\", round(np.var(y), 2))\nprint(\"CUPED dispersiyasi (qisqargan):\", round(np.var(y_cuped), 2))",
        "expectedOutput": "Boshlang'ich dispersiya: 7.76\nCUPED dispersiyasi (qisqargan): 0.22"
      },
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-15-11-2",
        "titleUz": "2-misol: Sensitivity va MDE aloqasi — Kovariatsiya Orqali Kerakli Vaqtni Qisqartirish Bahosi",
        "explanationUz": "Dispersiya $1 - \\rho^2$ miqdorida qisqarsa, talab qilinadigan namuna va sinov muddati ham shuncha kamayadi.",
        "code": "def calculate_sample_reduction_percent(correlation_rho: float) -> float:\n    # Variance reduction ratio = rho^2\n    return round((correlation_rho ** 2) * 100, 1)\n\nprint(\"Korrelyatsiya r=0.7 bo'lganda tejash foizi:\", calculate_sample_reduction_percent(0.7), \"%\")",
        "expectedOutput": "Korrelyatsiya r=0.7 bo'lganda tejash foizi: 49.0 %"
      }
    ],
