    "id": "mlds-18-04",
    "phaseId": "mlds-18",
    "order": 18,
    "title": "Decision boundary",
    "status": "planned",
    "learningObjectiveUz": "«Decision boundary» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.",
    "theoryUz": "### Decision boundary\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Decision boundary” — Klassifikatsiya Modellari (Logistik, Daraxtlar, SVM) yo'nalishining asosiy qismlaridan biridir.\nUshbu mavzuda o'rganiladigan asosiy terminlar: Logistic Regression, Sigmoid Function, Decision Tree, Gini Impurity, Entropy, SVM, Margin.\n«Decision boundary» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Matematik Mantiq (Under the Hood):**\nScikit-learn vositalari yordamida parametrlar va matritsalar qat'iy mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda transformatsiya qilinadi. Kiruvchi ma'lumotlar o'lchami tekshiriladi, xatoliklar (chegaraviy shartlar) filtrlangan holda optimal natija hosil qilinadi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction quvurlarida ushbu usul ma'lumotlar oqimining barqarorligi, xotira tejamkorligi va modelning barqaror bashorat berishini kafolatlaydi.",
    "visualFlow": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "label": "Chiziqli Ball (Logit)",
        "detail": "z = W · X + b skalyar hisobi"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "label": "Sigmoid Aktivatsiya",
        "detail": "Ballni 0 va 1 oralig'idagi ehtimollikka aylantirish"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "label": "Qaror Chegarasi (0.5)",
        "detail": "Threshold orqali sinf (0 yoki 1) ga ajratish"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "label": "Gini / Entropiya Bahosi",
        "detail": "Daraxtlar tugunlaridagi tozalik darajasini optimallash"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-18-04-1",
        "titleUz": "1-misol: Decision boundary — Sigmoid Aktivatsiyasi va Ehtimollik Bashorati",
        "explanationUz": "Formula: $\\sigma(z) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z}}$. Har qanday haqiqiy sonni $(0, 1)$ oraliqqa siqadi.",
        "code": "import math\n\ndef sigmoid(z: float) -> float:\n    # Overflow himoyasi\n    z = max(-500.0, min(500.0, z))\n    return round(1.0 / (1.0 + math.exp(-z)), 4)\n\nprint(\"z = 0 dagi ehtimollik:\", sigmoid(0.0))\nprint(\"z = 2.5 dagi ehtimollik:\", sigmoid(2.5))\nprint(\"z = -2.5 dagi ehtimollik:\", sigmoid(-2.5))",
        "expectedOutput": "z = 0 dagi ehtimollik: 0.5\nz = 2.5 dagi ehtimollik: 0.9241\nz = -2.5 dagi ehtimollik: 0.0759"
      },
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-18-04-2",
        "titleUz": "2-misol: Decision boundary — Decision Tree Gini Ifloslanish (Impurity) Indeksi",
        "explanationUz": "Formula: $\\text{Gini} = 1 - \\sum p_i^2$. Sof tugunda 0 ga teng, teng taqsimotda maksimal (0.5).",
        "code": "def calculate_gini(labels: list[int]) -> float:\n    n = len(labels)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    p0 = labels.count(0) / n\n    p1 = labels.count(1) / n\n    return round(1.0 - (p0**2 + p1**2), 4)\n\nprint(\"To'liq toza tugun [1, 1, 1]:\", calculate_gini([1, 1, 1]))\nprint(\"Aralash tugun [1, 0, 1, 0]:\", calculate_gini([1, 0, 1, 0]))",
        "expectedOutput": "To'liq toza tugun [1, 1, 1]: 0.0\nAralash tugun [1, 0, 1, 0]: 0.5"
      }
    ],
