    "id": "mlds-19-05",
    "phaseId": "mlds-19",
    "order": 19,
    "title": "Accuracy nima?",
    "status": "planned",
    "learningObjectiveUz": "«Accuracy nima?» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.",
    "theoryUz": "### Accuracy nima?\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Accuracy nima?” — Modelni Baholash va Metrikalar yo'nalishining asosiy qismlaridan biridir.\nUshbu mavzuda o'rganiladigan asosiy terminlar: Confusion Matrix, Precision, Recall, F1-Score, ROC-AUC, Log Loss, Class Imbalance.\n«Accuracy nima?» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Matematik Mantiq (Under the Hood):**\nScikit-learn vositalari yordamida parametrlar va matritsalar qat'iy mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda transformatsiya qilinadi. Kiruvchi ma'lumotlar o'lchami tekshiriladi, xatoliklar (chegaraviy shartlar) filtrlangan holda optimal natija hosil qilinadi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction quvurlarida ushbu usul ma'lumotlar oqimining barqarorligi, xotira tejamkorligi va modelning barqaror bashorat berishini kafolatlaydi.",
    "visualFlow": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "label": "Haqiqiy vs Bashorat",
        "detail": "Y_true va Y_pred qiymatlarini solishtirish"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "label": "Xatolar Matritsasi",
        "detail": "TP, FP, TN, FN sonlarini to'rtburchakka ajratish"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "label": "Precision va Recall",
        "detail": "Aniqlik va to'liqlik ko'rsatkichlarini hisoblash"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "label": "F1 va ROC-AUC",
        "detail": "Yagona garmonik baho orqali model sifatini tasdiqlash"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-19-05-1",
        "titleUz": "1-misol: Accuracy nima? — Precision, Recall va F1-Score Hisoblagich",
        "explanationUz": "Formula: $\\text{Precision} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FP}$, $\\text{Recall} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FN}$, $\\text{F1} = 2 \\cdot \\frac{P \\cdot R}{P + R}$.",
        "code": "def compute_classification_metrics(tp: int, fp: int, fn: int) -> dict:\n    p = tp / (tp + fp) if (tp + fp) > 0 else 0.0\n    r = tp / (tp + fn) if (tp + fn) > 0 else 0.0\n    f1 = (2 * p * r) / (p + r) if (p + r) > 0 else 0.0\n    return {\"precision\": round(p, 4), \"recall\": round(r, 4), \"f1_score\": round(f1, 4)}\n\nprint(\"Metrikalar:\", compute_classification_metrics(tp=80, fp=20, fn=10))",
        "expectedOutput": "Metrikalar: {'precision': 0.8, 'recall': 0.8889, 'f1_score': 0.8421}"
      },
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-19-05-2",
        "titleUz": "2-misol: Accuracy nima? — Binary Cross-Entropy (Log Loss) Hisoblash",
        "explanationUz": "Ehtimolliklar sifatini jazolovchi yo'qotish funksiyasi: $-\\frac{1}{N} \\sum [y \\ln p + (1-y) \\ln(1-p)]$.",
        "code": "import math\n\ndef binary_log_loss(y_true: list[int], y_prob: list[float]) -> float:\n    eps = 1e-15\n    losses = []\n    for y, p in zip(y_true, y_prob):\n        p_clipped = max(eps, min(1.0 - eps, p))\n        loss = -(y * math.log(p_clipped) + (1 - y) * math.log(1 - p_clipped))\n        losses.append(loss)\n    return round(sum(losses) / len(losses), 4)\n\nprint(\"Log Loss xatoligi:\", binary_log_loss([1, 0, 1], [0.9, 0.1, 0.8]))",
        "expectedOutput": "Log Loss xatoligi: 0.1446"
      }
    ],
