    "theoryUz": "### Outlier va anomaly tushunchasi\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Outlier va anomaly tushunchasi” — Klasterlash Algoritmlari (K-Means, DBSCAN) yo'nalishining asosiy qismlaridan biridir.\nUshbu mavzuda o'rganiladigan asosiy terminlar: K-Means, Centroids, WCSS (Inertia), Elbow Method, Silhouette Score, DBSCAN, Density-based.\n«Outlier va anomaly tushunchasi» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Matematik Mantiq (Under the Hood):**\nScikit-learn vositalari yordamida parametrlar va matritsalar qat'iy mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda transformatsiya qilinadi. Kiruvchi ma'lumotlar o'lchami tekshiriladi, xatoliklar (chegaraviy shartlar) filtrlangan holda optimal natija hosil qilinadi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction quvurlarida ushbu usul ma'lumotlar oqimining barqarorligi, xotira tejamkorligi va modelning barqaror bashorat berishini kafolatlaydi.",
    "visualFlow": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "label": "Sentroidlarni Tanlash",
        "detail": "K ta tasodifiy markazni fazoga joylashtirish"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "label": "Eng Yaqin Nuqtalar",
        "detail": "Har bir namunani eng yaqin sentroid klasteriga biriktirish"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "label": "Markazlarni Ko'chirish",
        "detail": "Har bir klaster nuqtalarining o'rtachasini yangi sentroid qilish"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "label": "Yig'ilish (Convergence)",
        "detail": "Sentroidlar siljimay qolganda optimal klasterlarni chiqarish"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-22-16-1",
        "titleUz": "1-misol: Outlier va anomaly tushunchasi — K-Means Nuqtadan Sentroidgacha Masofani Hisoblash",
        "explanationUz": "Har bir nuqta uchun eng kichik Evklid masofasiga ega bo'lgan sentroid indeksini tanlash.",
        "code": "import math\n\ndef assign_nearest_centroid(point: tuple[float, float], centroids: list[tuple[float, float]]) -> int:\n    best_dist = float(\"inf\")\n    best_idx = -1\n    for idx, c in enumerate(centroids):\n        dist = math.sqrt((point[0] - c[0])**2 + (point[1] - c[1])**2)\n        if dist < best_dist:\n            best_dist = dist\n            best_idx = idx\n    return best_idx\n\ncentroids = [(0.0, 0.0), (10.0, 10.0)]\nprint(\"Nuqta (1.0, 2.0) qaysi klasterga tegishli:\", assign_nearest_centroid((1.0, 2.0), centroids))\nprint(\"Nuqta (8.0, 9.0) qaysi klasterga tegishli:\", assign_nearest_centroid((8.0, 9.0), centroids))",
        "expectedOutput": "Nuqta (1.0, 2.0) qaysi klasterga tegishli: 0\nNuqta (8.0, 9.0) qaysi klasterga tegishli: 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-22-16-2",
        "titleUz": "2-misol: Outlier va anomaly tushunchasi — Yangi Sentroid Markazlarini Yangilash",
        "explanationUz": "Klasterga tushgan barcha nuqtalar koordinatalarining o'rtacha qiymatini hisoblash.",
        "code": "def update_centroid(cluster_points: list[tuple[float, float]]) -> tuple[float, float]:\n    n = len(cluster_points)\n    if n == 0:\n        return (0.0, 0.0)\n    avg_x = sum(p[0] for p in cluster_points) / n\n    avg_y = sum(p[1] for p in cluster_points) / n\n    return (round(avg_x, 2), round(avg_y, 2))\n\npts = [(1.0, 2.0), (2.0, 4.0), (3.0, 6.0)]\nprint(\"Yangi hisoblangan sentroid markazi:\", update_centroid(pts))",
        "expectedOutput": "Yangi hisoblangan sentroid markazi: (2.0, 4.0)"
      }
    ],
