    "title": "RNN hidden state",
    "status": "planned",
    "learningObjectiveUz": "«RNN hidden state» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.",
    "theoryUz": "### RNN hidden state\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“RNN hidden state” — Tabiiy Tilni Qayta Ishlash (NLP & RNN) yo'nalishining asosiy qismlaridan biridir.\nUshbu mavzuda o'rganiladigan asosiy terminlar: Tokenization, Word2Vec, Recurrent Neural Network (RNN), Hidden State, LSTM, Forget Gate, GRU.\n«RNN hidden state» mavzusining nima ekanini, qayerda va nima uchun ishlatilishini mustaqil tushuntira olish.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Matematik Mantiq (Under the Hood):**\nNLP vositalari yordamida parametrlar va matritsalar qat'iy mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda transformatsiya qilinadi. Kiruvchi ma'lumotlar o'lchami tekshiriladi, xatoliklar (chegaraviy shartlar) filtrlangan holda optimal natija hosil qilinadi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction quvurlarida ushbu usul ma'lumotlar oqimining barqarorligi, xotira tejamkorligi va modelning barqaror bashorat berishini kafolatlaydi.",
    "visualFlow": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "label": "Ketma-ketlik Kirishi",
        "detail": "Vaqt bo'yicha ketma-ket so'zlar X_t"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "label": "Yashirin Holat (Hidden)",
        "detail": "O'tmish xotirasini saqlovchi vektor h_t = tanh(W x + U h)"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "label": "LSTM Darvozalari",
        "detail": "Forget, Input va Output orqali muhim axborotni filtrlash"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "label": "Matn Xulosasi",
        "detail": "Sentiment tahlil yoki keyingi so'z ehtimoli"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-28-03-1",
        "titleUz": "1-misol: RNN hidden state — Oddiy RNN Yashirin Holati (Hidden State) Yangilanishi",
        "explanationUz": "Formula: $h_t = \\tanh(W_{xh} x_t + W_{hh} h_{t-1} + b)$. O'tmish va joriy so'zni birlashtirish.",
        "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndef rnn_step(x_t: np.ndarray, h_prev: np.ndarray, W_xh: np.ndarray, W_hh: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    z = np.dot(x_t, W_xh) + np.dot(h_prev, W_hh)\n    return np.round(np.tanh(z), 3)\n\nx_word = np.array([1.0, 0.0])\nh_old = np.array([0.5, -0.5])\nW_x = np.array([[0.2, 0.8], [0.1, 0.3]])\nW_h = np.array([[0.5, 0.1], [0.2, 0.4]])\nprint(\"Yangi yashirin holat h_t:\", rnn_step(x_word, h_old, W_x, W_h))",
        "expectedOutput": "Yangi yashirin holat h_t: [0.336 0.635]"
      },
      {
        "id": "ex-mlds-28-03-2",
        "titleUz": "2-misol: RNN hidden state — LSTM Forget Gate (Unutish Darvozasi) Mantiqi",
        "explanationUz": "Formula: $f_t = \\sigma(W_f [h_{t-1}, x_t] + b_f)$. Keraksiz eski ma'lumotni 0 ga ko'paytirib o'chiradi.",
        "code": "import math\n\ndef lstm_forget_gate(similarity_to_old_topic: float) -> float:\n    # Sigmoid orqali eslab qolish ulushini (0 dan 1 gacha) aniqlash\n    return round(1.0 / (1.0 + math.exp(-similarity_to_old_topic)), 3)\n\nprint(\"Mavzu o'zgarganda (past moslik):\", lstm_forget_gate(-3.0))\nprint(\"Mavzu davom etganda (yuqori moslik):\", lstm_forget_gate(2.5))",
        "expectedOutput": "Mavzu o'zgarganda (past moslik): 0.047\nMavzu davom etganda (yuqori moslik): 0.924"
      }
    ],
